# Local notes — pingone-aic-manager

Machine-specific paths, tenants, and tooling. **Gitignored — never commit this
file.** Copy to `.ai/local.md` and fill in.

**No secrets.** Record _where_ a credential comes from, never its value. The
vault master password lives in `.envrc`; the service-account JWK and log API
keys live encrypted in `.aic/`. Nothing belongs here but paths and hostnames.

## Tenant

The tenant list lives in `.aic/config.toml` (gitignored, created by
`aic ctx add`). Note here which tenant you normally work against and anything
surprising about it.

- Default context: `<name>` — `https://<tenant-host>` (sandbox / prod?)

## Sibling checkouts

`docs/api/*.md` cite evidence from checkouts by `~/w/…` path. Record which of
them actually exist here; mark the rest missing so an agent stops looking.

- `<repo>`: `/path/to/<repo>` — <why you'd open it>
- `<repo>`: **not present on this machine** — cited in `docs/api/<file>.md`

